{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14893","headline":"洛阳早春忆吉中孚校书司空曙主簿因寄清江上人 · 卢纶","name":"洛阳早春忆吉中孚校书司空曙主簿因寄清江上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"值迥逢高驻马频，雪晴闲看洛阳春。\n莺声报远同芳信，柳色邀欢似故人。\n酒貌昔将花共艳，鬓毛今与草争新。\n年来百事皆无绪，唯与汤师结净因。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14893.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14893","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}